=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Travel to the Beastmen Ensign at (I-8) in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)}.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.
* Two parties of {m:Yagudos|Yagudo} (4x {m:Yagudo Guard}, 1x {m:Yagudo Carrier}) will start moving slowly in different directions. The objective of this mission is to kill all 10 {m:Yagudos|Yagudo} before they reach the end of their route.
** The {m:Carrier|Yagudo Carrier} will run off as soon as he's engaged, so you'll need to kill him quickly.
** Should a {m:Carrier|Yagudo Carrier} make it to the end of the area, which is quite large, the mission is failed.
* Once all ten {m:Yagudos|Yagudo} are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
* **You must exit the area by using the Twilight Aureola for {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to successfully complete the mission!**
** You cannot warp out.
* Return and talk to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} for your reward.

=2 Notes
* Can be cleaved quite comfortably with a reasonably geared BLU.
* Campaign Operation becomes available after some combination __(information needed)__ of:
** All players server-wide have completed {p:Pit Spider II (W)} 16 times.
** {p:Windurst} Reconnaissance statistic level 4 (talk to {n:Maruna-Kurina} to see current level)

